{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02638","headline":"黄颊山 · 王绩","name":"黄颊山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别有青溪道，斜亘碧岩隈。\n崩榛横古蔓，荒石拥寒苔。\n野心长寂寞，山径本幽回。\n步步攀藤上，朝朝负药来。\n几看松叶秀，频值菊花开。\n无人堪作伴，岁晚独悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}